@guide H_54_WesternPlaguelands
@name Western Plaguelands (56)
@faction Horde
@levels 56-56
@zone Western Plaguelands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Western Plaguelands, visit 1 of 2 on the Horde route, levels 56.
@next H_55_EasternPlaguelands

